WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.925 --> 00:00:03.257
TheraBreath took away the burn.

2
00:00:03.257 --> 00:00:06.257
Now, let’s give more people
a reason to want it.

3
00:00:06.967 --> 00:00:08.257
Here’s the math.

4
00:00:08.257 --> 00:00:12.297
Mouthwash is in sixty-five of
every hundred American homes.

5
00:00:12.367 --> 00:00:14.647
TheraBreath is in fourteen.

6
00:00:14.667 --> 00:00:17.907
That leaves eighty-six who
haven’t been introduced yet.

7
00:00:17.967 --> 00:00:20.407
Flavor is how we say hello.

8
00:00:21.267 --> 00:00:24.907
In July, you came to Norco
and watched us make flavor.

9
00:00:24.967 --> 00:00:26.887
Then Ross asked for more:

10
00:00:26.887 --> 00:00:29.927
new flavor experiences that
strengthen your appeal with loyal

11
00:00:29.927 --> 00:00:33.527
users, and attract new
consumers to the franchise.

12
00:00:34.777 --> 00:00:36.537
So: November ninth.

13
00:00:36.537 --> 00:00:38.377
Two hours. Four chapters.

14
00:00:38.377 --> 00:00:39.737
One Playbook.

15
00:00:40.487 --> 00:00:42.447
Chapter one, Signals.

16
00:00:42.447 --> 00:00:43.367
Seven of them.

17
00:00:43.367 --> 00:00:44.967
You vote for three.

18
00:00:45.107 --> 00:00:46.427
Then Flavor School:

19
00:00:46.427 --> 00:00:50.587
how cooling works, and how flavor
survives inside your formula.

20
00:00:50.787 --> 00:00:52.707
Chapter two, Territories.

21
00:00:52.707 --> 00:00:55.267
Four platforms, and a blind tasting.

22
00:00:55.287 --> 00:00:59.127
Four cups, four letters, no
names until you’ve tasted.

23
00:00:59.287 --> 00:01:01.127
Chapter three, Concepts.

24
00:01:01.127 --> 00:01:04.967
Two teams build, tune on
The Bench, pitch, and vote.

25
00:01:05.087 --> 00:01:06.927
Chapter four, Pipeline.

26
00:01:06.927 --> 00:01:08.887
Now, next, later.

27
00:01:08.887 --> 00:01:10.687
With owners and dates.

28
00:01:10.787 --> 00:01:14.787
And by noon, a Flavor Playbook,
with your names on the cover.

29
00:01:15.687 --> 00:01:17.687
The Future of Freshness.

30
00:01:17.787 --> 00:01:20.237
Let’s build it together.

